"280\" class=\"sublbl\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(hỗn hợp gồm Ala, Lys, Glu)</text> </g> <!-- Divider --> <line x1=\"355\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"355\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,4\"/> <!-- Right: Sau điện di --> <g transform=\"translate(375, 20)\"> <text x=\"145\" y=\"22\" class=\"tag\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sau quá trình điện di</text> <!-- Power supply --> <rect x=\"100\" y=\"42\" width=\"90\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> <text x=\"145\" y=\"63\" class=\"txt\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Nguồn điện</text> <!-- Wires --> <path d=\"M 100,58 L 45,58 L 45,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M 190,58 L 245,58 L 245,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <text x=\"45\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt atom-n\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(-)</text> <text x=\"245\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt atom-o\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(+)</text> <!-- Tank --> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"115\" width=\"230\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/> <rect x=\"45\" y=\"130\" width=\"12\" height=\"80\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/> <text x=\"51\" y=\"226\" class=\"txt atom-n\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cathode</text> <rect x=\"233\" y=\"130\" width=\"12\" height=\"80\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/> <text x=\"239\" y=\"226\" class=\"txt atom-o\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Anode</text> <!-- Three bands --> <!-- Band 1: Lysine (+) -> Cathode (-) --> <rect x=\"85\" y=\"135\" width=\"16\" height=\"70\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> <text x=\"93\" y=\"224\" class=\"txt\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(1)</text> <!-- Band 2: Alanine (neutral) -> Center --> <rect x=\"137\" y=\"135\" width=\"16\" height=\"70\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> <text x=\"145\" y=\"224\" class=\"txt\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d97706\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(2)</text> <!-- Band 3: Glutamic acid (-) -> Anode (+) --> <rect x=\"188\" y=\"135\" width=\"16\" height=\"70\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#9333ea\" stroke=\"#7e22ce\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> <text x=\"196\" y=\"224\" class=\"txt\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9333ea\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(3)</text> <!-- Summary note --> <text x=\"145\" y=\"258\" class=\"txt\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Thứ tự vệt tách (1), (2), (3):</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"278\" class=\"txt\" text-anchor=\"middle\"> <tspan fill=\"#16a34a\" font-weight=\"700\">Lys (1)</tspan> <tspan fill=\"#64748b\"> → </tspan> <tspan fill=\"#d97706\" font-weight=\"700\">Ala (2)</tspan> <tspan fill=\"#64748b\"> → </tspan> <tspan fill=\"#9333ea\" font-weight=\"700\">Glu (3)</tspan> </text> </g> </svg>",
